description:
A newsletter signup: a heading, a pitch, a list of perks, an email form with a spam honeypot and a note, and social links - composed from Field, Input, Button, Thumbnail and Icon.

  Newsletter(action: subscriptions_path, socials: [ { href: "https://github.com/acme", icon: :brand_github, label: "GitHub" } ]) do
    NewsletterPerk(icon: :sparkles) { "Major library updates" }
    NewsletterPerk(icon: :template) { "Premium templates" }
  end

The form posts `email` to `action:` (Turbo submits it) once the browser has validated it; a bot filling the hidden `website` field is dropped. On success the note turns into a thank-you and `blocks--newsletter:subscribed` fires with { email }. Without an `action:` it runs a demo. Strings: newsletter.locales.yml.

examples.code:
phlex do
  div(class: [ ("dark" if dark), "bg-background w-full max-w-2xl rounded-2xl p-8 md:p-12" ].compact.join(" ")) do
    Newsletter(method:, honeypot:, **given(title:, note:), description:, socials: SOCIALS) do
      NewsletterPerk(icon: :sparkles) { "Major library updates" }
      NewsletterPerk(icon: :template) { "Premium templates" }
      NewsletterPerk(icon: :components) { "New component releases" }
    end
  end
end

example_helpers.SOCIALS:
SOCIALS = [
  { href: "https://x.com/Appica_dev", icon: :brand_x, label: "X" },
  { href: "https://github.com/appica-dev/appica-ui", icon: :brand_github, label: "GitHub" }
].freeze
